Package: ProteomicsR
Title: Multi-Organ Proteomics Analysis Pipeline
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Leong", "Ng", email = "lln1@leicester.ac.uk", role = "aut"),
    person("Marta", "Nascimento", email = "marta.parente.nascimento@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: A multi-organ proteomics analysis pipeline for mouse tissues and
    plasma. Supports half-minimum imputation, batch correction via RUViii-PRPS
    and ARSyNseq/TMM normalisation, differential expression with limma/voom,
    UniProt-to-gene symbol conversion via org.Mm.eg.db and UniProt.ws, and QC
    visualizations including RLE plots, PCA, volcano plots, and heatmaps.
    Tissue and plasma pipelines are provided as separate functions.
